WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Kneel on the right knee and extend the left leg out to the side, foot flat.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Inhale and reach the right arm overhead, palm facing down.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Exhale and side-bend over the left leg, resting the left hand on the shin or ankle.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Keep the chest open toward the sky — avoid collapsing forward.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Inhale to rise and switch sides.
